  "summary": "Ghost before 6.20.0 File Read via URL Encoding Bypass",
  "details": "Ghost versions before 6.20.0 contain a file extension filtering bypass vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to read theme templates and metadata. Attackers can use URL encoding to bypass extension validation and access sensitive theme files.",
